      "h2": "My Name Is",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Ich heisse</strong> + your name. 'Ich heisse Sam'. Ask: <strong>Wie heisst du?</strong> = 'What's your name?' (informal).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Hi",
      "h2": "How Are You?",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Wie geht es dir?</strong> = How are you? Reply <strong>Mir geht's gut</strong> (I'm good). Then ask <strong>Und dir?</strong> (And you?).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Meet",
      "h2": "Pleased to Meet",
      "body_html": "<p>When meeting someone new: <strong>Freut mich</strong> = pleased to meet you. Shake hands — Germans usually shake hands when meeting.</p>"
